This confirms `Server.Start` (line 129) calls `startBackgroundRunners`, which creates and launches the runner (lines 161–171).

h01.

**Component:** The `s3presign.Runner` background job (`server/runner/s3presign/runner.go`) — it re-presigns S3-backed attachment URLs before they expire, refreshing `LastPresignedTime`/`Reference` via `Store.UpdateAttachment`.

**Schedule:** Runs once immediately on startup, then on a repeating `time.NewTicker` every 12 hours (`runnerInterval = time.Hour * 12`). Each pass skips any attachment whose presigned URL was refreshed within the last 4 days, since presigned URLs are issued with a 5‑day expiry — see:

